    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761920/extras/e454ef06d9d9cb537240855a890b9cf3.avif?t=1752098806\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For a young man who has been abandoned by his father and not doing well, finding a bag filled with $500,000 can be very tempting. But if he gets that bag, will his life be as good as he imagined?\u200b</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761920/extras/343e8d9bcff8db234874b3484241f84f.avif?t=1752098806\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunpowder Cocktail is a story about a young man who will experience major changes in his life after meeting a mob boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not have a straight flow and contains different paths that you can follow in its story. There are many choices you can make, a lot of hot girls you can f... *ahem* fall in love with and lots of villains you could face. Accordingly, it contains NTR and similar fetishes that you can experience as a result of the choices you make. So your choices will have a big impact on the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want all the girls for yourself? Then play your cards right. Because it's a wolf's den.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761920/extras/187cf443d4c7ad371201c4f90919bca5.avif?t=1752098806\" width=598 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You can win the hearts of all love interests and live a happy 